# RaceVeil environment variables — placeholders only, never real values.
# Read exclusively through internal/config (CLAUDE.md §2.1 security invariant
# — no raw os.Getenv in feature code).
#
# .rv finding artifacts template live secrets as ${ENV} placeholders
# (Design/SECURITY.md §5) so they can be replayed without embedding
# credentials in the artifact itself. This file documents that convention;
# it is not exhaustive until Phase 1 auth/session handling lands.

# Example: a templated session credential a replayed .rv might reference.
# RACEVEIL_SESSION_TOKEN=
